		"The shared catalogue of the document key (plan 43-15, D-43-14): an internal path out of oc_filecache.path and the key both sides must derive from it.",
		"The key is sha256 hex over the path in Unicode normalisation form C with every leading slash removed, otherwise unchanged: no lower casing, and the prefix files/ is NOT cut (W2), because home storages are never grouped and an external path that starts with files/ must stay apart from the same path without it.",
		"Every expected value was computed by hand with the command in its derivation field, never with the code under test. A path with a decomposed character is hashed in its composed form, so its derivation names the composed spelling.",
